WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.320
Our Connections – Ō Tātou Hononga

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:14.560
Good access, infrastructure and transport helps to ensure

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.320
there is a high quality of
life in the Waimakariri District.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:25.120
With 11,000 residents travelling to Christchurch
for work each day, our inter-district connections

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:28.480
are critical to meeting the expectations of
commuters.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:34.320
Increased use of public transport and alternative
commuting options will be required to avoid

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.000
increasing congestion.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:43.600
We also need to ensure our towns are well
connected by roads, cycleways and public transport

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.240
to cater for our growing population and that
infrastructure keeps up with growth.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:54.540
We also need to think about emerging transport
technologies such as autonomous and electric

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:59.680
vehicles and the potential increased digital
connectivity has to replace commuting.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.440
Our District - Our Future, Waimakariri 2048
aims to:

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.280
So what do you think?

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:33.729
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.760
waimakariri.govt.nz

